{"id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-sieve.md","title":"Definition — Sieve","display":"Definition — Sieve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-sieve","aliases":["14-df-sieve"],"display":"Definition — Sieve","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-sieve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-sieve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Sieve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (category, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (object)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为集合，是筛谓词的候选输入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod}\\)</span> (category operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}\\)</span> (hom-set operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}\\)</span> (sieve operations defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies，印刷页 109–115。</p>\n<p>筛是所有射入固定对象的箭头中对前合成封闭的子集，等价于表示预层的子预层。极大筛含所有射入箭头。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)$ (category, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod}$ (category operations, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}$ (hom-set operation, see [[14-df-morphism]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S).","display":true}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve|Definition — Sieve]]"},{"id":"f51bc0e57c805ccf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-小且有有限极限的范畴；$J$ 是 Grothendieck 拓扑，筛见 [[14-df-sieve]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]"},{"id":"de8df30671642cb0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}$ (sieve predicates, see [[14-df-sieve]])"},{"id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$、$\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 采用 [[14-df-sieve]]；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}$ 采用 [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]。"},{"id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1782799288dd0ec","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]"},{"id":"e213602dd9109075","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)$ (sieve, see [[14-df-sieve]])"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]"},{"id":"005f78978592c0bb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"080e5a6c2d99d959","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve|Definition — Sieve]]"},{"id":"d09d6567cd8efb10","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3ac28cc449b6cd1f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c5452002ba29fda"]}